--- !u!114 &422931829
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 422931827}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c33952e69819f61448bf84371676b486, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: I believe these are the machines used to conduct the experiments.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: A shrinker and a grower...
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: You
    text: Please, don't call them that.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: Well, anyways, I will analyze these machines later while rewatching the
      volumetric scan footage. We have to get out.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: You
    text: What about the "destroy the facility" part of plan?
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: Oh, right, I think I know the way to accomplish just that.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: You
    text: What is it then?
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: You'll have to collect the missing power cells for the APU, then get to
      the control room to your right. You may find them in the storage room to your
      left.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: You
    text: Understood.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  isPlayed: 0
