--- !u!114 &1445918041
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1445918039}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c33952e69819f61448bf84371676b486, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: Setting up comms... One, two, one, two.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: All clear?
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: You
    text: Affirmative. Hear you loud and clear.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: Good. I will be your assistant for this mission. Your task for today is
      to explore an abandoned scientific facility.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: Before being abandoned though, this base has emitted a burst of powerful
      gravitational waves.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: Must be spacetime experiments, which are, as you know, highly illegal...
      which is also exactly the reason that you're sent here.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: Explore the base, find all the clues, destroy the facility and get out.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: You
    text: Understood.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  - speaker: Mission Assistant
    text: Also, everything you do is recorded and will be thoroughly analyzed. Good
      luck.
    fastForwardKey: 102
    skipKey: 102
  isPlayed: 0
